      "refersTo": "auth-panel",
      "description": "Shared masthead, form alignment and route switch on the public entry pages.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-auth\" aria-label=\"Sign in\"><header><strong><span><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 13.74a2 2 0 0 1-2 0L2.5 8.87a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.74L11 2.26a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l8.5 4.87a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.74z\"/><path d=\"m20 14.285 1.5.845a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.74L13 21.74a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-8.5-4.87a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.74l1.5-.845\"/></svg></span>TaskFlow</strong><svg class=\"ds-auth-wave\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMid slice\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 160\" fill=\"none\" ><g stroke=\"#a59bcf\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M-18 175 C65 140 55 17 132 22 S229 160 321 -12\"/> <path d=\"M-13 175 C69 140 60 17 137 22 S234 160 326 -12\"/> <path d=\"M-8 175 C73 140 65 17 142 22 S239 160 331 -12\"/> <path d=\"M-3 175 C77 140 70 17 147 22 S244 160 336 -12\"/> <path d=\"M2 175 C81 140 75 17 152 22 S249 160 341 -12\"/> <path d=\"M7 175 C85 140 80 17 157 22 S254 160 346 -12\"/> <path d=\"M12 175 C89 140 85 17 162 22 S259 160 351 -12\"/> <path d=\"M17 175 C93 140 90 17 167 22 S264 160 356 -12\"/> <path d=\"M22 175 C97 140 95 17 172 22 S269 160 361 -12\"/> <path d=\"M27 175 C101 140 100 17 177 22 S274 160 366 -12\"/> <path d=\"M32 175 C105 140 105 17 182 22 S279 160 371 -12\"/> <path d=\"M37 175 C109 140 110 17 187 22 S284 160 376 -12\"/> <path d=\"M42 175 C113 140 115 17 192 22 S289 160 381 -12\"/></g></svg></header><div class=\"ds-box\"><h1>Welcome back</h1><p>Sign in to your TaskFlow account.</p><div class=\"ds-field\"><label for=\"ds-email\">Email address</label><input type=\"email\" id=\"ds-email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></div><div class=\"ds-field\"><label for=\"ds-password\">Password</label><input id=\"ds-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-primary\">Sign in</button><footer>New to TaskFlow? <a href=\"/register\">Create an account</a></footer></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-auth,.ds-auth *{box-sizing:border-box}.ds-auth{font:400 15px/1.5 'DM Sans Variable',sans-serif;max-width:480px;border:1px solid #dbd9e5;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;color:#29273b;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-auth header{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:84px;overflow:hidden;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,38px);background:#e8e4f6;border-radius:13px 13px 0 0}.ds-auth header strong{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-1.3px;font-weight:690}.ds-auth header span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9px;background:#51468b;color:white}.ds-auth-wave{margin-left:auto;width:40%;height:84px}.ds-box{padding:28px clamp(20px,4vw,38px) 20px}.ds-box h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,36px);font-weight:600;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.035em}.ds-box p{margin:8px 0 24px;color:#585567}.ds-box .ds-field{margin-bottom:18px}.ds-box footer{border-top:1px solid #dbd9e5;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;font-size:14px;color:#585567}.ds-box footer a{color:#29273b;font-weight:650;text-underline-offset:3px}.ds-field { font-family: var(--font-sans, 'DM Sans Variable', sans-serif); color: #29273b; } .ds-field label { display: block; margin-bottom: 7px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; } .ds-field input { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-height: 48px; padding: 12px; font: inherit; color: inherit; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #888298; border-radius: 9px; } .ds-field input[aria-invalid=\"true\"] { border-color: #c45145; } .ds-field input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #5744a5; outline-offset: 4px; }.ds-primary { font-family: var(--font-sans, 'DM Sans Variable', sans-serif); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 650; color: white; background: #51468b; border: 0; border-radius: 9px; width: 100%; min-height: 44px; padding: 12px 19px; cursor: pointer; } .ds-primary:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); } .ds-primary:disabled { opacity: .7; cursor: wait; } .ds-primary:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #5744a5; outline-offset: 4px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "auth-submit",
      "description": "Submit an authentication form.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-primary\">Sign in</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary { font-family: var(--font-sans, 'DM Sans Variable', sans-serif); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 650; color: white; background: #51468b; border: 0; border-radius: 9px; width: 100%; min-height: 44px; padding: 12px 19px; cursor: pointer; } .ds-primary:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); } .ds-primary:disabled { opacity: .7; cursor: wait; } .ds-primary:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #5744a5; outline-offset: 4px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "View account",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "account-link",
      "description": "Navigate from Overview to Account.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-account\" href=\"/app/account\">View account <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-account{font-family:var(--font-sans,'DM Sans Variable',sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:9px;background:#51468b;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:650}.ds-account:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}.ds-account:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #5744a5;outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Email field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "text-input",
      "description": "A labeled email input on the public forms.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><label for=\"ds-email\">Email address</label><input type=\"email\" id=\"ds-email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field { font-family: var(--font-sans, 'DM Sans Variable', sans-serif); color: #29273b; } .ds-field label { display: block; margin-bottom: 7px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; } .ds-field input { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-height: 48px; padding: 12px; font: inherit; color: inherit; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #888298; border-radius: 9px; } .ds-field input[aria-invalid=\"true\"] { border-color: #c45145; } .ds-field input:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #5744a5; outline-offset: 4px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-current",
      "description": "Workspace destinations with the current page highlighted.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/app\" aria-current=\"page\">Overview</a><a href=\"/app/account\">Account</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--font-sans,'DM Sans Variable',sans-serif);display:grid;gap:5px;background:#eeedf6;padding:12px}.ds-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:8px 14px;min-height:44px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;color:#29273b;font-size:14px;font-weight:550}.ds-nav a:hover{background:#e8e4f6}.ds-nav a[aria-current]{color:#493d80;background:#dcd9ef;font-weight:650}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #5744a5;outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Account identity",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "identity-strip",
      "description": "Name and signed-in state with a decorative wave.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-identity\" aria-label=\"Account identity\"><span class=\"ds-initials\" aria-hidden=\"true\">AL</span><div class=\"ds-copy\"><h2>Avery Lane</h2><p>Signed in to TaskFlow</p></div><svg class=\"ds-wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 160\" fill=\"none\" ><g stroke=\"#a59bcf\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M-18 175 C65 140 55 17 132 22 S229 160 321 -12\"/> <path d=\"M-13 175 C69 140 60 17 137 22 S234 160 326 -12\"/> <path d=\"M-8 175 C73 140 65 17 142 22 S239 160 331 -12\"/> <path d=\"M-3 175 C77 140 70 17 147 22 S244 160 336 -12\"/> <path d=\"M2 175 C81 140 75 17 152 22 S249 160 341 -12\"/> <path d=\"M7 175 C85 140 80 17 157 22 S254 160 346 -12\"/> <path d=\"M12 175 C89 140 85 17 162 22 S259 160 351 -12\"/> <path d=\"M17 175 C93 140 90 17 167 22 S264 160 356 -12\"/> <path d=\"M22 175 C97 140 95 17 172 22 S269 160 361 -12\"/> <path d=\"M27 175 C101 140 100 17 177 22 S274 160 366 -12\"/> <path d=\"M32 175 C105 140 105 17 182 22 S279 160 371 -12\"/> <path d=\"M37 175 C109 140 110 17 187 22 S284 160 376 -12\"/> <path d=\"M42 175 C113 140 115 17 192 22 S289 160 381 -12\"/></g></svg></section>",
      "css": ".ds-identity{font-family:var(--font-sans,'DM Sans Variable',sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;isolation:isolate;position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:152px;padding:30px 36px;border-radius:14px;background:#e8e4f6;color:#29273b}.ds-copy{max-width:55%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-copy h2{margin:0;font-size:30px;font-weight:620;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ds-copy p{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#585567}.ds-copy p:before{content:'';display:block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#33705c}.ds-initials{display:grid;place-items:center;width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:18px;background:#51468b;color:white;font-size:24px;font-weight:650}.ds-wave{position:absolute;right:0;top:0;width:30%;height:100%;z-index:-1}@media(max-width:740px){.ds-wave{display:none}.ds-identity{min-height:124px;padding:18px;gap:12px}.ds-copy{max-width:none}.ds-copy h2{font-size:24px}.ds-initials{width:46px;height:46px;font-size:18px;border-radius:13px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Profile card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "profile-card",
      "description": "Labeled account data with dividing rules.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-profile\" aria-label=\"Profile details\"><h2>Profile details</h2><dl><div><dt>Full name</dt><dd>Avery Lane</dd></div><div><dt>Email address</dt><dd>avery@example.invalid</dd></div><div><dt>Time zone</dt><dd>UTC</dd></div></dl></section>",
      "css": ".ds-profile{font-family:var(--font-sans,'DM Sans Variable',sans-serif);padding:12px 30px;border:1px solid #dbd9e5;border-radius:14px;color:#29273b;background:#fff}.ds-profile h2{margin:12px 0 18px;font-size:21px;font-weight:620}.ds-profile dl{margin:0}.ds-profile dl>div{border-top:1px solid #dbd9e5;min-height:62px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(90px,36%) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;gap:12px}.ds-profile dt{font-size:14px;color:#585567}.ds-profile dd{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:520;overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:420px){.ds-profile{padding:8px 16px}.ds-profile dl>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-content:center;gap:3px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Cove",
    "overview": "The same violet wordmark greets people at sign-in and in the workspace. A centered form gives returning users a direct route to their account. Registration adds the name field and password guidance within the same layout.\n\nIn the workspace, the route title orients the reader before the name, signed-in status and account details. The lavender wave appears beside the brand on public forms and beside the account identity on the desktop dashboard.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One reading column for the form, its validation messages and the link to the other route.",
      "A fixed position for the current destination in desktop navigation and a keyboard-accessible drawer on phones.",
      "Plain-language status, field labels and account values in both color schemes."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Surface Palette Rule",
        "body": "Resolve the palette on the page shell and on the mobile drawer, which renders outside that shell.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do give password hints and errors space below their field.",
      "Do keep the navigation dialog’s focus inside the drawer and return focus to its opener when dismissed.",
      "Do allow account values and form messages to wrap as text grows."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't let the decorative wave cover a label, control or account name.",
      "Don't use a color change as the only indication of an invalid field, active route or session state."
    ]
  }
}
